            our services
        </h4>
        <h1 class="title col-lg-10 col-12" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
          {{ service_title.value }}
        </h1>
        <p class="col-lg-7 col-12" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="150">
